      {
        "id": "dont",
        "title": "“I don’t …”",
        "body": [
          "Mu Luganda otandika n’**si-**: **saagala**, **sirya**. Mu Lungereza oteeka **don’t** mu maaso g’ekikolwa: **I don’t want. I don’t eat. I don’t know.**",
          "Ku kiragiro, **Don’t** kitandika: **Don’t go! Don’t be afraid.**"
        ],
        "table": [
          ["Oluganda", "Olungereza"],
          ["saagala", "I don’t want"],
          ["sirya", "I don’t eat"],
          ["simanyi", "I don’t know"],
          ["togenda!", "Don’t go!"]
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "there-isnt",
        "title": "“I don’t have” ne “there is no”",
        "body": [
          "**Sirina** kiba **I don’t have**: **I don’t have money.** **Tewali** kiba **there is no** oba **there isn’t**: **There is no water.**"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "doesnt",
        "title": "He doesn’t, she isn’t",
        "body": [
          "Ku **he**, **she** ne **it** kozesa **doesn’t**: **He doesn’t eat meat.** Ku kikolwa ekikolebwa kati, kozesa **isn’t**: **Nakato isn’t going to school today.**"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Okugaana mu bukkakkamu",
        "body": [
          "Mu Lungereza **No** yokka eyinza okuwulikika ng’ekakali. Yongerako **thank you**: **No, thank you.** Oba gamba **Not now, maybe tomorrow.**"
        ]
      }
    ]
